  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">진도가 느리죠? 5단원 먼저하고 4단원으로 왔습니다.<br>저는 그게 더 효과적이란 생각이 들어서요^^<br>갑자기 온라인 수업으로 바뀌면서 학생들에게 주사기와 마개, 고무풍선을 나눠주고 같이 실험했습니다. <br><br>이 과정에서 질문하는 영상을 짧게 만들어놓으면 원격, 등교수업에 모두 사용 가능할 것 같아 짧은 영상들을 찍었습니다.<br>자료 제작에 큰 시간을 쏟지않아 퀄리티는 매우 낮지만<br>필요하시면 쓰세요^^<br><br>유투브에도 올려놓아습니다. <br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvp34vkfwkv3dprb0ml22yda4@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvp34vkfwkv3dprb0ml22yda4%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33163279264%26signature%3D2rTeow%252FoI8JLyMIleYnEv5%252Fg%252B%252BI%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvp34vkfwkv3dprb0ml22yda4?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2cDM0dmtmd2t2M2RwcmIwbWwyMnlkYTQiLCJ0aWQiOiIzNWQzYjE2NC1hN2EyLTQyYWEtOTZlYi1iMzljNDliNzg1NGIiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODQwNjJ9.WDLAtFNdRGDEO0adPJ_7tvzr_W3FvAPBNHRAO3SLplJ_bg4orqtwu9pwxqOUHKXT-NP67hJCnZZvb5waJUAAqw&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">P-V 관계 1</div></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv1nn5shtizb1hgy1zcc5ezvs@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-styl